#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:2
msgid "Host-VM Groups"
msgstr "Grupos Host-VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:7
msgid ""
"Host-VM Groups define affinity and anti-affinity rules that control the "
"placement of virtual machines on specific hosts within a cloud or "
"cluster. These groups allow administrators to:"
msgstr "Os Grupos Host-VM definem regras de afinidade e anti-afinidade que controlam o posicionamento de máquinas virtuais em hosts específicos dentro de uma nuvem ou cluster. Esses grupos permitem que administradores:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:9
msgid "Pin VMs to specific hosts (affinity)"
msgstr "Fixem VMs em hosts específicos (afinidade)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:10
msgid "Prevent VMs from running on the same host (anti-affinity)"
msgstr "Impeçam que VMs sejam executadas no mesmo host (anti-afinidade)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:11
msgid "Group hosts and VMs for licensing, compliance, or performance requirements"
msgstr "Agrupem hosts e VMs para requisitos de licenciamento, conformidade ou desempenho"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:13
msgid ""
"Host-VM Groups can be configured at the Cloud level or the Cluster "
"(Server Group) level."
msgstr "Os Grupos Host-VM podem ser configurados no nível da Nuvem ou no nível do Cluster (Server Group)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:16
msgid "Role Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos de Função"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:18
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Clouds`` or ``Infrastructure: Clusters`` role "
"permission at **Full** or **Group** access is required to create, edit, "
"or delete Host-VM Groups."
msgstr "É necessária a permissão de função ``Infrastructure: Clouds`` ou ``Infrastructure: Clusters`` com acesso **Full** ou **Group** para criar, editar ou excluir Grupos Host-VM."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:19
msgid "**Read** access allows viewing Host-VM Groups only."
msgstr "O acesso **Read** permite apenas visualizar os Grupos Host-VM."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:22
msgid "Viewing Host-VM Groups"
msgstr "Visualizando Grupos Host-VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:24
msgid "From a Cloud:"
msgstr "A partir de uma Nuvem:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:26
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clouds``"
msgstr "Navegue até ``Infrastructure > Clouds``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:27
msgid "Click the name of a Cloud"
msgstr "Clique no nome de uma Nuvem"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:28
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:34
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:42
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:71
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:80
msgid "Select the **HOST-VM GROUPS** tab"
msgstr "Selecione a aba **HOST-VM GROUPS**"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:30
msgid "From a Cluster:"
msgstr "A partir de um Cluster:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:32
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters``"
msgstr "Navegue até ``Infrastructure > Clusters``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:33
msgid "Click the name of a Cluster"
msgstr "Clique no nome de um Cluster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:36
msgid ""
"The list displays all configured Host-VM Groups with their name, type, "
"and member count."
msgstr "A lista exibe todos os Grupos Host-VM configurados com nome, tipo e contagem de membros."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:39
msgid "Creating a Host-VM Group"
msgstr "Criando um Grupo Host-VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:41
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:70
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:79
msgid "Navigate to the Cloud or Cluster detail page"
msgstr "Navegue até a página de detalhes da Nuvem ou do Cluster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:43
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:44
msgid "Configure the following fields:"
msgstr "Configure os seguintes campos:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:46
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:47
msgid "A descriptive name for the group."
msgstr "Um nome descritivo para o grupo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:48
msgid "TYPE"
msgstr "TYPE"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:49
msgid "The group type determines the placement behavior:"
msgstr "O tipo do grupo determina o comportamento de posicionamento:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Affinity** — VMs in this group should run on the specified hosts. Use "
"for workloads that need to be co-located."
msgstr "**Affinity** — As VMs deste grupo devem ser executadas nos hosts especificados. Use para cargas de trabalho que precisam ficar co-localizadas."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Anti-Affinity** — VMs in this group should NOT run on the same host. "
"Use for high-availability configurations."
msgstr "**Anti-Affinity** — As VMs deste grupo NÃO devem ser executadas no mesmo host. Use para configurações de alta disponibilidade."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Site Group** — (Cluster-level only) Groups hosts and VMs by "
"site/location."
msgstr "**Site Group** — (Somente no nível do Cluster) Agrupa hosts e VMs por site/localização."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:55
msgid "RESOURCE POOL"
msgstr "RESOURCE POOL"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:56
msgid "(Cloud-level groups) Select the resource pool that this group applies to."
msgstr "(Grupos no nível da Nuvem) Selecione o resource pool ao qual este grupo se aplica."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:57
msgid "SERVERS"
msgstr "SERVERS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:58
msgid ""
"Select the hosts (hypervisor servers) that are members of this group. "
"Multiple hosts can be selected."
msgstr "Selecione os hosts (servidores hypervisor) que são membros deste grupo. Vários hosts podem ser selecionados."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:59
msgid "TENANT PERMISSIONS"
msgstr "TENANT PERMISSIONS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:60
msgid "Control which tenants can see and use this Host-VM Group:"
msgstr "Controle quais tenants podem ver e usar este Grupo Host-VM:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:62
msgid "**Public** — Visible to all tenants"
msgstr "**Public** — Visível para todos os tenants"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:63
msgid "**Private** — Visible only to selected tenants"
msgstr "**Private** — Visível apenas para tenants selecionados"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:65
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:74
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:68
msgid "Editing a Host-VM Group"
msgstr "Editando um Grupo Host-VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:72
msgid "Click the edit icon next to the group"
msgstr "Clique no ícone de edição ao lado do grupo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:73
msgid "Modify the desired fields (name, servers, permissions)"
msgstr "Modifique os campos desejados (nome, servidores, permissões)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:77
msgid "Deleting a Host-VM Group"
msgstr "Excluindo um Grupo Host-VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:81
msgid "Click the delete icon next to the group"
msgstr "Clique no ícone de exclusão ao lado do grupo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:82
msgid "Confirm the deletion in the prompt"
msgstr "Confirme a exclusão no prompt"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:84
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Alerta"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:84
msgid ""
"Deleting a Host-VM Group removes the affinity/anti-affinity constraint. "
"Existing VMs will not be automatically migrated but future placement "
"decisions will no longer consider the deleted rule."
msgstr "Excluir um Grupo Host-VM remove a restrição de afinidade/anti-afinidade. As VMs existentes não serão migradas automaticamente, mas as decisões futuras de posicionamento não considerarão mais a regra excluída."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:87
msgid "Use Cases"
msgstr "Casos de Uso"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:89
msgid "High Availability"
msgstr "Alta Disponibilidade"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:90
msgid ""
"Create an anti-affinity group containing VMs that form an HA cluster "
"(e.g., database replicas). This ensures they are placed on different "
"hosts so that a single host failure does not take down all replicas."
msgstr "Crie um grupo de anti-afinidade contendo VMs que formam um cluster HA (por exemplo, réplicas de banco de dados). Isso garante que sejam posicionadas em hosts diferentes para que a falha de um único host não derrube todas as réplicas."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:92
msgid "Licensing Compliance"
msgstr "Conformidade de Licenciamento"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:93
msgid ""
"Create an affinity group to ensure VMs that require specific host-level "
"licenses (e.g., Oracle, SQL Server) are placed only on properly licensed "
"hosts."
msgstr "Crie um grupo de afinidade para garantir que VMs que exigem licenças específicas no nível do host (por exemplo, Oracle, SQL Server) sejam posicionadas apenas em hosts devidamente licenciados."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:95
msgid "Performance Isolation"
msgstr "Isolamento de Desempenho"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:96
msgid ""
"Create affinity groups to co-locate VMs that frequently communicate with "
"each other, reducing network latency."
msgstr "Crie grupos de afinidade para co-localizar VMs que se comunicam com frequência, reduzindo a latência de rede."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:98
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_vm_groups.rst:98
msgid ""
"Host-VM Groups are enforced by |morpheus| during provisioning and "
"migration operations. The underlying hypervisor's native DRS/affinity "
"rules may also apply depending on the cloud configuration."
msgstr "Os Grupos Host-VM são aplicados pelo |morpheus| durante as operações de provisionamento e migração. As regras nativas de DRS/afinidade do hypervisor subjacente também podem se aplicar, dependendo da configuração da nuvem."

